  "content": "<div>\n<div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT/MP_MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT_Header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2380\" height=\"874\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>多重箭矢特效</strong> 增加了一種新的合成機制，允許你將最多三種藥水效果合併到一支箭矢中，統一它們的所有屬性，從而創造出極具多功能性和策略性的投射物。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT/MP_MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT_Description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"236\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">此模組允許你組合藥水箭矢，並將它們的屬性合併為一次射擊。你可以在一支箭矢上疊加最多三種不同的藥水效果，創造出能同時施加多種效果的強力投射物。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1396590/description_b5ceb87e-ed2f-456a-9c49-4403ed3be7dc.png\" width=\"368\" height=\"285\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">所有設定均可完全自訂：你可以調整合併效果的最大數量、微調持續時間、阻止特定藥水，或直接從配置檔案中更改合成行為，使系統適應任何世界或模組整合包。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">它與其他箭矢和藥水模組完全相容，允許使用遊戲中任何藥水的效果。藥水箭的製作方法是將滯留型藥水瓶用箭矢包圍，讓你應用任何效果，之後再將它們合併為一支增強型的單一投射物。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_eb7f55c5-3947-420b-89ff-328b3a283b3e.png\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong>想和朋友一起玩嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT/MP_MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT_Promo.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"353\"></strong></a></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>今天就在 BisectHosting 建立屬於你的 Minecraft 伺服器吧</strong></a></span><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">，與朋友們享受無盡的冒險！憑藉頂級的性能和可靠的運行時間，我們的伺服器保證了每個人都能獲得流暢且有趣的遊戲體驗。使用代碼 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>THEWIZARD</strong> </a>可享受 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">25% 折扣！</span></strong></a></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FqhuAjYTGv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT/MP_MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT_Discord.webp\" width=\"2382\" height=\"235\"></span></a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
